<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Patch>

	<!--
		Big and Small - Simply Robots tuning, through the robots' B&S PawnExtension filters and race settings:
		  - hediffs robots can never get (other mods' diseases, parasites, allergies, plagued claws);
		  - gene tags and categories robots cannot carry (blood, bleeding, immunity, leather/meat, cell instability; drugs
		    for the commando bot and TV android; mood for the non-sapient ones);
		  - no VAE Insanity sanity need for the TV android and the non-sapient commando bot (vanilla disablesNeeds);
		  - surgeries robots cannot take (VGE animal-part implants) and traits they cannot have (drug, food, sexuality and
		    flesh-body traits, several per mod);
		  - food and drink the commando bot and TV android will never eat, each entry MayRequire'd; with Alpha Crafts, its
		    sake too unless T's Samurai Faction is installed (that part lives in the BigAndSmallSimplyRobots_WithoutTsSamuraiFaction folder).
		This folder only loads when Simply Robots is active (see loadFolders.xml). Entries for other mods carry MayRequire.
		Changes from the original: an exact duplicate op (adding Drugs to the same geneCategoryFilters blacklist twice) was
		dropped. Simply Robots is not installed here, so its defs could not be checked.
	-->
